  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/670/642/goblintraders_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/504/mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"需要 Framework\" width=\"222\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️ <strong>Minecraft 1.20.1 及更高版本的 Goblin Traders 現在需要 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/503/244/icon.png\" alt=\"Framework 圖示\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\">Framework</a></strong></p>\n<h5>📖 <strong>關於</strong></h5>\n<p>Goblin Traders 是一個簡單的模組，新增了具有獨特交易的哥布林。與流浪商人類似，哥布林會隨機生成於地底洞穴或下界中，提供獨家且實用的交易，助你的冒險邁向新境界！本模組新增了兩種商販：出沒於主世界的「哥布林商販」與出沒於下界的「礦脈哥布林商販」；兩者皆擁有專屬的交易列表。這些小傢伙脾氣有點倔，不喜歡被玩家攻擊。如果你樂意分享，可以餵牠們最愛的食物，觸發有趣的動畫。</p>\n<h5>📦 <strong>整合包開發者</strong></h5>\n<p>Goblin Traders 已內建透過數據包修改交易的支援。若想進一步了解，可參考關於如何修改交易的 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goblin-traders/pages/how-to-modify-trades\" rel=\"nofollow\">詳細指南</a>。該指南還附有範例數據包可供下載。</p>\n<h5>🎨 <strong>遊戲截圖</strong></h5>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/242/newscreenshot1a.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/243/newscreenshot2a.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/244/newscreenshot3.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"632\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/245/newscreenshot4.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"632\"></strong></p>\n<h5>🙋 <strong>需要支援或想追蹤模組開發進度？</strong></h5>\n<p>留言區並不適合用於尋求技術支援，因此 MrCrayfish 建議你加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xN1MMCY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;Discord 社群</span></a>。在這裡你可以獲得安裝與設定模組、解決崩潰問題等協助！此外，你還能第一時間掌握模組更新與開發動態（比其他管道更快取得消息）！ <strong>點擊下方橫幅加入 🔽</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/639/926/discordbanner.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"88\"></a></p>",
